        "TileImage": "$($repository a23f4ad5-6857-4501-a53d-53522a671b88).Image",
        "Description": "47, in order to help us take down the Milton-Fitzpatrick bank we need to get a man on the inside. But the managers who are doing the job interviews - Melissa Chien and Kevin Nardone - are extremely scrupulous, and their ruthlessly diligent vetting is sure to stonewall our attempts. Not to mention that they&apos;re close aides of Savalas and are surely helping her keep an eye out for potential moles. It would be best to get them out of the way - as quietly as you can.",
